<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Lord, You are the living vine,</l><l>In You we would abide;</l><l>Only You give life divine;</l><l>Only You satisfy.</l><l>So we must praise</l><l>And we must sing,</l><l>And we must testify;</l><l>Lord, You are the only One;</l><l>Only You satisfy.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
